safix::mapping_wrong_direction

  × the mapping 'ntfy-token' is declared safix-to-clan, which 'safix export'
  │ acts on.
  │ 
  │ 'safix import' acts on the other direction. Either run
  │ 
  │     safix export ntfy-token
  │ 
  │ or change the mapping's direction if it is declared the wrong way round.
